583: the exact phase matrix and determinant, both cap-cut identities,
584: the origin difference, the sheet-orbit gcd calculation, the
585: Riemann--Hurwitz genus, and every arithmetic polynomial in the
586: tables. Its JSON links the actual construction and integral topology
587: proofs. The proof of the global maps and line identification is
